window.auguraToolData.yutSticks = {"signs":[{"id":"111","hanja":"兒見慈母","hangul":"아견자모","ko":"아이가 자애로운 어머니를 만난다.","line":"A child meets a kind mother.","reflection":"Who makes you feel safe? Spend a quiet moment with them, in person or in memory."},{"id":"112","hanja":"鼠入倉中","hangul":"서입창중","ko":"쥐가 곡식 창고에 들어간다.","line":"A mouse slips into the granary.","reflection":"Where is there plenty right now? Take what you need and notice what is already enough."},{"id":"113","hanja":"昏夜得燭","hangul":"혼야득촉","ko":"어두운 밤에 촛불을 얻는다.","line":"A candle appears in the dark of night.","reflection":"Even a small light shows the next step. What is yours?"},{"id":"114","hanja":"蒼蠅遇春","hangul":"창승우춘","ko":"파리가 봄을 만난다.","line":"A fly meets the spring.","reflection":"Warmth wakes everything up. What in you is ready to stir?"},{"id":"121","hanja":"大水逆流","hangul":"대수역류","ko":"큰물이 거꾸로 흐른다.","line":"A great river runs backward.","reflection":"When things feel turned around, slow down and look at the whole river before you step in."},{"id":"122","hanja":"罪中立功","hangul":"죄중입공","ko":"잘못 가운데서 공을 세운다.","line":"Good work grows out of a mistake.","reflection":"A slip can hold the start of something useful. What did you learn lately?"},{"id":"123","hanja":"飛蛾撲燈","hangul":"비아박등","ko":"나방이 등불로 날아든다.","line":"A moth flies toward the lamp.","reflection":"What draws you in? Admire the light, and keep a little distance."},{"id":"124","hanja":"金鐵遇火","hangul":"금철우화","ko":"쇠가 불을 만난다.","line":"Metal meets fire.","reflection":"Heat can shape as well as test. What is being shaped in you?"},{"id":"131","hanja":"鶴失羽翼","hangul":"학실우익","ko":"학이 날개를 쉬며 기다린다.","line":"A crane rests while its wings mend.","reflection":"Some seasons are for mending. What needs rest before you go on?"},{"id":"132","hanja":"飢者得食","hangul":"기자득식","ko":"배고픈 이가 먹을 것을 얻는다.","line":"A hungry person is given a meal.","reflection":"Receiving is also a skill. What help could you accept, or offer?"},{"id":"133","hanja":"龍入大海","hangul":"용입대해","ko":"용이 큰 바다로 들어간다.","line":"A dragon enters the great sea.","reflection":"A wide place gives room to grow. Where do you have room to stretch?"},{"id":"134","hanja":"龜入筍中","hangul":"귀입순중","ko":"거북이 대나무 숲으로 들어간다.","line":"A turtle slips into the bamboo.","reflection":"Slow and steady finds shelter. Is there a quiet place you can settle into?"},{"id":"141","hanja":"樹木無根","hangul":"수목무근","ko":"뿌리를 내릴 자리를 찾는 나무.","line":"A young tree looks for ground to root in.","reflection":"Roots take time. What could you tend a little each day?"},{"id":"142","hanja":"死者復生","hangul":"사자부생","ko":"끝난 줄 알았던 것이 다시 시작된다.","line":"Something thought finished begins again.","reflection":"A fresh start is allowed. What would you like to pick up again?"},{"id":"143","hanja":"寒者得衣","hangul":"한자득의","ko":"추운 이가 옷을 얻는다.","line":"Someone cold is given a warm coat.","reflection":"Small comforts matter. Whom could you warm today?"},{"id":"144","hanja":"貧者得寶","hangul":"빈자득보","ko":"가난한 이가 보물을 얻는다.","line":"A person of modest means finds a treasure.","reflection":"Treasure is not always gold. What do you already have that you value?"},{"id":"211","hanja":"日入雲中","hangul":"일입운중","ko":"해가 구름 속으로 들어간다.","line":"The sun slips behind a cloud.","reflection":"Clouds pass. What can you do while you wait for the light?"},{"id":"212","hanja":"霖天見日","hangul":"임천견일","ko":"장마 하늘에 해가 보인다.","line":"The sun shows in a rainy sky.","reflection":"After long rain, a bright patch. Step outside and look up."},{"id":"213","hanja":"弓失羽箭","hangul":"궁실우전","ko":"활이 화살을 잃는다.","line":"A bow has mislaid its arrow.","reflection":"Something is missing for now. Is it worth a calm look around?"},{"id":"214","hanja":"鳥無羽翰","hangul":"조무우한","ko":"아직 깃털이 자라지 않은 새.","line":"A fledgling whose feathers are still growing.","reflection":"Growing takes patience. What are you still learning?"},{"id":"221","hanja":"弱馬馱重","hangul":"약마태중","ko":"작은 말이 무거운 짐을 진다.","line":"A small horse carries a heavy load.","reflection":"You do not have to carry everything alone. What could you set down or share?"},{"id":"222","hanja":"鶴登于天","hangul":"학등우천","ko":"학이 하늘로 오른다.","line":"A crane rises into the sky.","reflection":"A view from above changes things. What looks different from farther away?"},{"id":"223","hanja":"飢鷹得肉","hangul":"기응득육","ko":"배고픈 매가 먹이를 얻는다.","line":"A hungry hawk finds a meal.","reflection":"Patience can be rewarded. What have you been waiting for?"},{"id":"224","hanja":"車無兩輪","hangul":"거무양륜","ko":"바퀴 둘이 다 갖춰지지 않은 수레.","line":"A cart still waiting for its second wheel.","reflection":"Some things need a partner to move. What would help you roll forward?"},{"id":"231","hanja":"嬰兒得乳","hangul":"영아득유","ko":"갓난아이가 젖을 얻는다.","line":"A baby is fed and held.","reflection":"Being cared for is a basic good. How can you care for yourself today?"},{"id":"232","hanja":"重病得藥","hangul":"중병득약","ko":"몸이 많이 아픈 이가 약을 얻는다.","line":"Someone who has been unwell finds the right remedy.","reflection":"Help can arrive. Is there something you could ask for?"},{"id":"233","hanja":"蝴蝶得花","hangul":"호접득화","ko":"나비가 꽃을 만난다.","line":"A butterfly finds a flower.","reflection":"Sweetness is close by. What small pleasure are you passing by?"},{"id":"234","hanja":"弓得羽箭","hangul":"궁득우전","ko":"활이 화살을 얻는다.","line":"A bow is given its arrow.","reflection":"Two good things fit together. What belongs with what you are doing?"},{"id":"241","hanja":"拜見疎賓","hangul":"배견소빈","ko":"낯선 손님에게 절하며 인사한다.","line":"You bow to greet a guest you do not know well.","reflection":"Welcome a new face. Who could you get to know better?"},{"id":"242","hanja":"河魚失水","hangul":"하어실수","ko":"강물고기가 물을 찾아 헤맨다.","line":"A river fish searches for deeper water.","reflection":"Feeling out of place is a sign to look for your own current. Where do you feel at home?"},{"id":"243","hanja":"水上生紋","hangul":"수상생문","ko":"물 위에 잔물결이 인다.","line":"Ripples spread across the water.","reflection":"A small thing travels far. What small thing could you start?"},{"id":"244","hanja":"龍得如意","hangul":"용득여의","ko":"용이 여의주를 얻는다.","line":"A dragon is given its wish-granting jewel.","reflection":"What do you wish for? Say it plainly, then ask what a first step would be."},{"id":"311","hanja":"大魚入水","hangul":"대어입수","ko":"큰 물고기가 물로 돌아간다.","line":"A big fish slides back into the water.","reflection":"Back where it belongs. Where do you feel most like yourself?"},{"id":"312","hanja":"炎天贈扇","hangul":"염천증선","ko":"무더운 날에 부채를 선물받는다.","line":"A fan is given on a hot day.","reflection":"A thoughtful gift arrives at the right time. What kindness could you pass on?"},{"id":"313","hanja":"鷙鷹無爪","hangul":"지응무조","ko":"발톱을 아직 다듬지 못한 매.","line":"A hawk that has not yet found its talons.","reflection":"Strength you do not feel yet is still on its way. What would help you feel ready?"},{"id":"314","hanja":"擲珠江中","hangul":"척주강중","ko":"구슬을 강에 던진다.","line":"A pearl is tossed into the river.","reflection":"Some gifts are meant to be let go. What could you release with a good heart?"},{"id":"321","hanja":"龍頭生角","hangul":"용두생각","ko":"용의 머리에 뿔이 돋는다.","line":"A dragon grows its horns.","reflection":"A sign of growing up. In what way have you grown lately?"},{"id":"322","hanja":"貧而且賤","hangul":"빈이차천","ko":"소박하고 겸손한 살림.","line":"A simple life of modest means.","reflection":"Little can be enough. What makes today feel full?"},{"id":"323","hanja":"貧士得祿","hangul":"빈사득록","ko":"가난한 선비가 녹봉을 얻는다.","line":"A scholar of modest means receives a post.","reflection":"Steady effort is noticed. What work are you glad to have done?"},{"id":"324","hanja":"貓兒得鼠","hangul":"묘아득서","ko":"고양이가 쥐를 잡는다.","line":"A kitten catches a mouse.","reflection":"Quick eyes, good timing. What chance is in front of you?"},{"id":"331","hanja":"魚變成龍","hangul":"어변성룡","ko":"물고기가 용이 된다.","line":"A fish becomes a dragon.","reflection":"Big changes begin in small ways. What could you try?"},{"id":"332","hanja":"牛得蒭荳","hangul":"우득추두","ko":"소가 꼴과 콩을 얻는다.","line":"An ox is given hay and beans.","reflection":"Hard work earns a good rest. Have you had yours?"},{"id":"333","hanja":"樹花成實","hangul":"수화성실","ko":"나무의 꽃이 열매가 된다.","line":"Blossoms on the tree become fruit.","reflection":"What you planted is ripening. What would you like to harvest?"},{"id":"334","hanja":"沙門還俗","hangul":"사문환속","ko":"스님이 다시 속세의 삶으로 돌아온다.","line":"A monk steps back into everyday life.","reflection":"Change of path is part of life. What routine would you like to change?"},{"id":"341","hanja":"行人思家","hangul":"행인사가","ko":"나그네가 집을 그리워한다.","line":"A traveler thinks of home.","reflection":"Home can be a place or a person. Whom might you call?"},{"id":"342","hanja":"馬無鞭策","hangul":"마무편책","ko":"채찍 없이 걷는 말.","line":"A horse walks on without a whip.","reflection":"Go at your own pace. What would you do if no one hurried you?"},{"id":"343","hanja":"行人得路","hangul":"행인득로","ko":"나그네가 길을 찾는다.","line":"A traveler finds the road.","reflection":"A direction appears. What is the next step on it?"},{"id":"344","hanja":"日照草露","hangul":"일조초로","ko":"햇살이 풀잎의 이슬을 비춘다.","line":"Sunlight on dew in the grass.","reflection":"A bright, brief moment. Take a breath and enjoy it."},{"id":"411","hanja":"父母得子","hangul":"부모득자","ko":"부모가 아이를 얻는다.","line":"Parents welcome a child.","reflection":"New life brings joy and work. What are you caring for now?"},{"id":"412","hanja":"有功無賞","hangul":"유공무상","ko":"애쓴 일이 아직 알려지지 않았다.","line":"Good effort that has not been noticed yet.","reflection":"Your work still counts. Could you tell someone about it, or thank yourself?"},{"id":"413","hanja":"龍入深淵","hangul":"용입심연","ko":"용이 깊은 못으로 들어간다.","line":"A dragon settles into a deep pool.","reflection":"Depth is a good place to think. What question is asking for quiet?"},{"id":"414","hanja":"盲人直門","hangul":"맹인직문","ko":"눈이 어두운 이가 문을 곧게 찾아간다.","line":"Someone finds the door by feel.","reflection":"Trust what you already know. What does your sense say?"},{"id":"421","hanja":"暗中見火","hangul":"암중견화","ko":"어둠 속에 불빛이 보인다.","line":"A light shows in the dark.","reflection":"Follow the light a little way. What is it pointing toward?"},{"id":"422","hanja":"人無手臂","hangul":"인무수비","ko":"일손이 모자란 하루.","line":"A day with more to do than hands to do it.","reflection":"Ask for a hand. Who could help?"},{"id":"423","hanja":"利見大人","hangul":"이견대인","ko":"훌륭한 분을 만나는 것이 이롭다.","line":"It is good to meet someone wise.","reflection":"Seek out a good guide. Who has something to teach you?"},{"id":"424","hanja":"角弓無弦","hangul":"각궁무현","ko":"아직 시위를 걸지 않은 활.","line":"A horn bow waiting to be strung.","reflection":"Preparation comes before the shot. What is left to set up?"},{"id":"431","hanja":"耳邊生風","hangul":"이변생풍","ko":"귓가에 바람이 인다.","line":"A breeze stirs by the ear.","reflection":"Listen: a small sign is passing. What did you just hear?"},{"id":"432","hanja":"穉兒得寶","hangul":"치아득보","ko":"어린아이가 보물을 얻는다.","line":"A small child is given a treasure.","reflection":"Handle gifts with care. What have you been given lately?"},{"id":"433","hanja":"得人還失","hangul":"득인환실","ko":"사람을 만났다가 다시 헤어진다.","line":"Someone arrives, and later goes their way.","reflection":"Meetings come and go. Hold the good in this one."},{"id":"434","hanja":"亂而不吉","hangul":"난이불길","ko":"얽힌 일이 아직 풀리지 않았다.","line":"A tangle that has not come loose yet.","reflection":"Pause and take one strand at a time. What is the easiest to start with?"},{"id":"441","hanja":"生事茫然","hangul":"생사망연","ko":"살림살이가 아직 아득하다.","line":"The way ahead is still hazy.","reflection":"A fog lifts slowly. What small thing can you see clearly?"},{"id":"442","hanja":"魚呑釣鉤","hangul":"어탄조구","ko":"물고기가 미끼를 물려 한다.","line":"A fish eyes the bait.","reflection":"Look before you bite. What is worth a second thought?"},{"id":"443","hanja":"飛鳥遇人","hangul":"비조우인","ko":"날던 새가 사람을 만난다.","line":"A bird in flight meets a person.","reflection":"A surprise meeting. Stay curious."},{"id":"444","hanja":"哥哥得弟","hangul":"가가득제","ko":"형이 아우를 얻는다.","line":"An older brother gains a younger brother.","reflection":"A new bond. Who is close to you now?"}]};
